  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "scenario": "prose-studio",
  "description": "Experience contract for Prose Studio. The scenario's central UX rule is that the interface must not rank candidates by taste: no per-card quality score, no default ordering by a quality proxy, and measurements shown as a feature vector rather than a verdict. Every disabled control states its specific cause inline.",
